# A hand-written export using every condition and instruction no cup export on the
# writing machine used: teamgoals, lead, mostgoals, special with a spaced label, time,
# home, bracketed and escaped tokens, speed, louder, warcry, unrandom, pause every,
# a slot-only line, both flags, and event clips.
name;Nijiura JP
sync;no
normalize;off

anthem;Anthem.mp3;match knockouts;start 1:02:03.5
anthem
victory;VA.mp3;special [Promotion Anthem];end stop
victory;VA home.mp3;home;teamgoals >= 3
goal;Goalhorn.mp3;opponent jp [v o];pause restart every 2;speed 1.25
chant;c.mp3;unrandom;louder

Cat Look Like Janny;janny warcry.mp3;warcry
Cat Look Like Janny;janny lead.mp3;lead > 1;mostgoals;time <= 45
Cat Look Like Janny;janny not.mp3;not mostgoals [Get Out];every 2
Get Out;endless tewi.mp3;goals = 1;special
Get Out;red.mp3;event red
Get Out;sub.mp3;event sub;start 0:02
Other 2hu reps:,Whale/Suffering;\[escaped].mp3;opponent \[v]
